-Default competition strategy (no online mapping is required):
-
-1. Scan and announce in the fixed LM2 -> LM6 order.
-2. Start the first grasp pass in LM6 -> LM2 order.  Every grasp station is
-   re-scanned on arrival; at most one object is attempted per station visit.
-3. A successful grasp always goes to SCORE_STATION (LM7) before continuing.
-4. Stations that were not successfully grasped stay in a retry queue.  After the
