-   the same descending order (for example LM5 -> LM4).
-5. A station is removed from the retry queue only after a successful grasp and
-   LM7 placement.  Retry until the queue is empty or the total mission time
-   reaches MATCH_SECONDS (8 minutes by default), then go to EXIT_STATION (LM8).
-
-The existing perception, grasp, and navigation implementations are reused.
